<title>NEW ZEALAND: FORECAST - Consensus of Tuesday's NZ CPI, FPI data.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus of Tuesday's NZ CPI, FPI data.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-10</dateline>
<text>
